{"version":1,"content":"<p>新城廣播帶同林奕匡（Phil）、鄧小巧、張馳豪（Aska）、范卓賢（Jacky Fan）、FYP、蘇詠淳（Vincy So），將《Metro U School Tour》帶入香港浸會大學。</p><p>Phil獻唱勵志歌《一雙手》及新歌《初戀無限Touch》，事後訪問亦分享兒子近况，笑言兒子不滿足聽他的歌，反而想聽韓國天團BTS的歌。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T10:59:51.564647+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":162,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T10:25:13+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T11:17:40.427522+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T10:57:40.581213+00:00","content_hash":"7cbba3f477e46ad6367e568eb3d6d16f75bba6e3ce498e7bc4e1696f8532dfba","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}